From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Original display-copy transport into owned GPU XFB snapshots
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: permanent native GX hardware/serialized-word transport.

Restore the pinned original display-copy producers, source field/stride/scale
quirks and BP ordering using canonical physical addresses. Capture original
copy/filter/format/clear requests at their FIFO position into destination-owned
GPU YUYV resources; completion requires the actual successful GPU submission.
Keep source buffer selection, request ordering and existing texture-copy paths.
Unsupported scaling/AA/gamma/field modes fail explicitly, never become ready.
Compose after SDK0029/0030 and independent native pipeline compiler SDK0031.
Original game code is untouched. CPU XFB coherence and VI presentation remain
separate boundaries; this patch does not enable nonblack scanout.

